# Every non-comment, non-blank line is text the failure diagnostic must contain.
# isTRIPLE() carries no triple-term SYNTAX of its own (its argument is a plain
# variable that could bind to any dataset value), so this pins that the whole
# §17.4.6 "Functions on Triple Terms" family is gated, not merely the
# triple-term grammar production.
native-sparql-query-eval
triple-term function
isTRIPLE()
